  <text>
    <body>
      <conceptEntry id="dpp-0108">
      <languageSection xml:lang="eng">
          <descrip type="definition">
            <p>concrete, clearly identifiable component of a certain type</p>
          </descrip>
          <note type="note">An individual entity of a type, for example a device, is obtained by defining specific property values.</note>
          <note type="note">In an object-oriented view, an instance denotes an object of a class (of a type).</note>
          <ref>IDTA-01001-3.2:2026 (Specification of the Asset Administration Shell — Part 1: Metamodel) 1.1.15</ref>
          <ref>IEC 62890:2016, 3.1.16 65/617/CDV</ref>
      </languageSection>
      </conceptEntry>
    </body>
  </text>
</tbx>
